  data: {
    LLM: "Game: Kryt'-Navalivat'. Logic: Beat and pile shedding game. Key: Must beat if possible, must pile after beating, escalating pickup penalties.",
    Player: "Kryt'-Navalivat' is a Russian shedding game from the Durak family. Beat the top card (higher same suit or any trump), then pile up a second card. Can't beat? Pickup penalty: plain=1, trump=3, ace of trumps=all. First to empty hand wins.",
    objective: 'Avoid being the last player left with cards in your hand after the stock is exhausted.',
    gameplay: "1. **Lead**: One player leads a card to the 'Play Pile'.\n2. **Response**: The opponent MUST beat the top card (higher of same suit or any Trump). If they beat it, they MUST 'Pile Up' a second card from their hand on top.\n3. **Failure to Beat**: If you cannot beat the card:\n   - If a plain card: Pick up only that card.\n   - If a Trump (not Ace): Pick up the top 3 cards of the pile.\n   - If the Ace of Trumps: Pick up the entire pile.",
    keyRules: [
      'Must beat the top card if possible',
      'After beating, must pile up a second card',
      'Cannot beat: pickup penalty based on card type',
      'Plain card: pickup 1 card',
      'Trump (not Ace): pickup 3 cards',
      'Ace of Trumps: pickup entire pile',
    ],
